---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout title="About blawy" description="Developer profile of blawy — a Linux enthusiast building software, experimenting with Python and creating tools.">
  <div class="about-page">
    <header class="about-hero" data-reveal>
      <span class="about-kicker">DEVELOPER PROFILE / 001</span>
      <h1>Hey, I'm <span class="name hover-text">blawy</span><span class="dot">.</span></h1>
      <p class="about-intro">
        Developer, Linux enthusiast and builder of things.
        Interested in software, terminal interfaces and understanding
        how everything works under the hood.
      </p>
      <div class="about-status">
        <span class="status-dot"></span>
        ALWAYS BUILDING SOMETHING
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="about-rule" data-reveal></div>

    <section class="about-section" data-reveal>
      <span class="section-index">01 / INTRODUCTION</span>
      <h2>Learning by building.</h2>
      <p>
        I'm a developer who enjoys experimenting with software,
        exploring Linux and turning ideas into working projects.
        I like understanding how things work rather than simply
        relying on tools without knowing what's happening behind them.
      </p>
      <p>
        A lot of my time goes into coding, tweaking my Linux setup,
        exploring new technologies and finding better ways to build things.
        I'm still learning, and that's a big part of why I enjoy development.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section" data-reveal>
      <span class="section-index">02 / INTERESTS</span>
      <h2>What I'm into.</h2>

      <div class="interest-grid">
        <div class="interest">
          <span class="interest-number">01</span>
          <h3>Linux</h3>
          <p>System configuration, terminal workflows, customisation and understanding the operating system.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="interest">
          <span class="interest-number">02</span>
          <h3>Development</h3>
          <p>Python, software architecture, command-line applications and building useful tools.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="interest">
          <span class="interest-number">03</span>
          <h3>Interfaces</h3>
          <p>Minimal design, terminal-inspired interfaces and software that feels good to use.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="interest">
          <span class="interest-number">04</span>
          <h3>Learning</h3>
          <p>Exploring new technologies, solving problems and improving through practical projects.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section" data-reveal>
      <span class="section-index">03 / PROJECTS</span>
      <h2>Things I've been building.</h2>

      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-top">
          <span class="project-type">01 / MAIN PROJECT</span>
          <span class="project-language">PYTHON</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Ghost<span class="dot">.</span></h3>
        <p>
          A Linux companion CLI designed to make system management,
          diagnostics and development easier. It also includes a
          structured Python learning experience with exercises,
          projects and optional progression.
        </p>
        <div class="project-tags">
          <span>Python</span>
          <span>Typer</span>
          <span>Rich</span>
          <span>Linux</span>
          <span>Astro</span>
        </div>
        <a href="https://github.com/blawyxd/ghost" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          VIEW SOURCE CODE ↗
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-top">
          <span class="project-type">02 / PERSONAL PROJECT</span>
          <span class="project-language">PYTHON</span>
        </div>
        <h3>CachyControl<span class="dot">.</span></h3>
        <p>
          A desktop control centre concept for CachyOS.
          Built with Python and PySide6, focused on system controls,
          development tools and a customisable interface.
        </p>
        <div class="project-tags">
          <span>Python</span>
          <span>PySide6</span>
          <span>CachyOS</span>
          <span>Linux</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section" data-reveal>
      <span class="section-index">04 / TOOLKIT</span>
      <h2>Tools I work with.</h2>
      <p>
        My current toolkit is centred around Linux and Python,
        with web technologies for building and presenting projects.
      </p>

      <div class="toolkit">
        <div><span>LANGUAGES</span><p>Python · Java · HTML · CSS · JavaScript</p></div>
        <div><span>FRAMEWORKS & LIBRARIES</span><p>PySide6 · Typer · Rich · Astro</p></div>
        <div><span>ENVIRONMENT</span><p>CachyOS · Linux · KDE Plasma · Fish</p></div>
        <div><span>TOOLS</span><p>Git · GitHub · IntelliJ IDEA · Kate</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section about-focus" data-reveal>
      <span class="section-index">05 / CURRENTLY</span>
      <h2>Still figuring things out.</h2>
      <p>
        I'm focused on improving my programming skills, expanding Ghost
        and experimenting with new ideas. I don't want to just collect
        technologies — I want to understand them and make things with them.
      </p>
      <p class="focus-ending">More projects. More learning. Better software.</p>
    </section>

    <footer class="about-footer" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <span class="section-index">BUILT BY</span>
        <p>blawy</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="section-index">SOURCE CODE</span>
        <p><a href="https://github.com/blawyxd/ghost" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a></p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</PageLayout>

<script>
  const reduceMotion = window.matchMedia(
    "(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)"
  ).matches;

  // Split heading text into individual hoverable letters.
  if (!reduceMotion) {
    document.querySelectorAll(
      ".about-page h1, .about-page h2, .about-page h3"
    ).forEach((heading) => {
      Array.from(heading.childNodes).forEach((node) => {
        if (node.nodeType !== Node.TEXT_NODE || !node.textContent) return;

        const letters = Array.from(node.textContent, (character) => {
          if (character.trim() === "") {
            return document.createTextNode(character);
          }

          const letter = document.createElement("span");
          letter.className = "hover-letter";
          letter.textContent = character;
          return letter;
        });

        node.replaceWith(...letters);
      });
    });
  }

  // Reveal sections as they enter the viewport.
  const revealItems = document.querySelectorAll(
    ".about-page [data-reveal], .about-page .interest, .about-page .project-card, .about-page .toolkit > div"
  );

  if (reduceMotion || !("IntersectionObserver" in window)) {
    revealItems.forEach((item) => item.classList.add("is-visible"));
  } else {
    revealItems.forEach((item, index) => {
      item.dataset.reveal = "";
      item.style.setProperty(
        "--reveal-delay",
        `${(index % 4) * 85}ms`
      );
    });

    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries, currentObserver) => {
      entries.forEach((entry) => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          entry.target.classList.add("is-visible");
          currentObserver.unobserve(entry.target);
        }
      });
    }, {
      threshold: 0.08,
      rootMargin: "0px 0px -25px 0px"
    });

    revealItems.forEach((item) => observer.observe(item));
  }
</script>

<style>
  .about-page {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .about-kicker,
  .section-index {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  }

  .about-hero {
    padding: 10px 0 0;
  }

  .about-kicker {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    font-size: clamp(64px, 10vw, 88px);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -6px;
  }

  .name {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1.2em;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.085em;
    text-shadow:
      0 0 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65),
      0 0 22px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4),
      0 0 48px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .name :global(.hover-letter:hover) {
    filter:
      drop-shadow(0 0 7px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95))
      drop-shadow(0 0 15px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65));
  }

  .dot {
    color: #777;
  }

  .about-intro {
    max-width: 610px;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .about-status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    color: #888;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1.3px;
  }

  .status-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #aaa;
    box-shadow: 0 0 9px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .about-rule {
    height: 1px;
    background: #292929;
    margin: 65px 0;
  }

  .about-section {
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .about-section h2 {
    margin: 14px 0 18px;
    font-size: 27px;
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
  }

  .about-section > p {
    max-width: 650px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .interest-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    margin-top: 30px;
    background: #292929;
    border: 1px solid #292929;
  }

  .interest {
    min-height: 155px;
    padding: 23px;
    background: #08090c;
  }

  .interest-number {
    color: #555;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .interest h3 {
    margin: 17px 0 8px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .interest p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #888;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .project-card {
    margin-top: 25px;
    padding: 25px;
    border: 1px solid #292929;
    background: #0d0e11;
    transition: border-color 200ms ease, background 200ms ease;
  }

  .project-card:hover {
    border-color: #555;
    background: #101114;
  }

  .project-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 15px;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
  }

  .project-card h3 {
    margin: 28px 0 12px;
    font-size: 26px;
  }

  .project-card > p {
    max-width: 600px;
    color: #999;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .project-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 22px 0;
  }

  .project-tags span {
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border: 1px solid #292929;
    color: #aaa;
    font-size: 10px;
    transition: border-color 180ms ease, color 180ms ease;
  }

  .project-tags span:hover {
    border-color: #777;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .project-card > a {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 5px;
    color: #ddd;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #666;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
    transition: color 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease;
  }

  .project-card > a:hover,
  .about-footer a:hover {
    color: #fff;
    border-color: #fff;
  }

  .toolkit {
    margin-top: 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid #292929;
  }

  .toolkit > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 190px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #292929;
  }

  .toolkit span {
    color: #666;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
  }

  .toolkit p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #ccc;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .focus-ending {
    color: #ddd;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .about-footer {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid #292929;
    padding-top: 25px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .about-footer p {
    color: #ddd;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .about-footer a {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #666;
    padding-bottom: 3px;
    transition: color 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease;
  }

  :global(.hover-letter) {
    display: inline-block;
    position: relative;
    transform-origin: center bottom;
    transition: transform 180ms ease, filter 180ms ease;
  }

  :global(.hover-letter:hover) {
    transform: scale(1.3);
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3));
  }

  :global([data-reveal]) {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(55px) scale(0.98);
    filter: blur(5px);
    transition:
      opacity 850ms cubic-bezier(.16, 1, .3, 1),
      transform 750ms cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1),
      filter 850ms cubic-bezier(.16, 1, .3, 1);
    transition-delay: var(--reveal-delay, 0ms);
  }

  :global([data-reveal].is-visible) {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
    filter: blur(0);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .about-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(52px, 13vw, 78px);
      letter-spacing: -4px;
    }

    .interest-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .toolkit > div {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 9px;
    }

    .project-card {
      padding: 18px;
    }

    .about-footer {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    :global([data-reveal]) {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
      filter: none;
      transition: none;
    }

    :global(.hover-letter) {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
